  "solution": "Given equation: 75 ÷ 15 × 8 + 14 - 5 = 67\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷ and × \n\nGiven: 75 ÷ 15 × 8 + 14 - 5 = 67\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 75 × __**15 ÷ 8**__ + 14 - 5 = 67\n\n⇒ __**75 × 1.875**__ + 14 - 5 = 67\n\n⇒ __140.625** + 14**__ - 5 = 67\n\n⇒ __154.625 - 5__ = 67\n\n⇒ 149.625 ≠ 67\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) - and ÷\n\nGiven: 75 ÷ 15 × 8 + 14 - 5 = 67\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 75 - 15 × 8 + __**14 ÷ 5**__ = 67\n\n⇒ 75 - __**15 × **____**8**__ + 2.8 = 67\n\n⇒ __**75**__ - 120 __**+**____** 2.8**__ = 67\n\n⇒ __77.8 - 120__ = 67\n\n⇒ -42.2 ≠ 67\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) - and ×\n\nGiven: 75 ÷ 15 × 8 + 14 - 5 = 67\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**75 ÷ 15**__ - 8 + 14 × 5 = 67\n\n⇒ 5 - 8 + **__14 × 5__ **= 67\n\n⇒ __**5**__ - 8 __**+ **__**__70__**= 67\n\n⇒ __75____ - 8__ = 67\n\n⇒ 67 = 67\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) + and -\n\nGiven: 75 ÷ 15 × 8 + 14 - 5 = 67\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**75 ÷ 15**__ × 8 - 14 + 5 = 67\n\n⇒ __**5 × 8**__ - 14 + 5 = 67\n\n⇒ __40__ - 14 __**+ 5**__ = 67\n\n⇒ __45 - 14__ = 67\n\n⇒ 31 ≠ 67\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
